{"seq":1,"slug":"cqrs-fundamentals","title":"CQRS 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/event-sourcing-cqrs/cqrs-patterns/cqrs-fundamentals","wordCount":1104,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"cqrs-基础\">CQRS 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CQRS（Command Query Responsibility Segregation，命令查询职责分离）是一种将数据的写操作（命令）和读操作（查询）拆分为两个独立模型的架构模式。传统的 CRUD 架构中，同一个模型既负责处理写入又负责响应查询，这在复杂系统中会导致模型臃肿、难以优化。CQRS 通过将读写职责彻底分离，让每一侧都能针对自己的需求进行独立优化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 传统CRUD&#10;        A[客户端] --&gt; B[统一模型]&#10;        B --&gt; C[(单一数据库)]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CQRS&#10;        D[客户端] --&gt; E[命令模型]&#10;        D --&gt; F[查询模型]&#10;        E --&gt; G[(写库)]&#10;        G --&gt; |同步/异步| H[(读库)]&#10;        H --&gt; F&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 传统CRUD\n        A[客户端] --&gt; B[统一模型]\n        B --&gt; C[(单一数据库)]\n    end\n    subgraph CQRS\n        D[客户端] --&gt; E[命令模型]\n        D --&gt; F[查询模型]\n        E --&gt; G[(写库)]\n        G --&gt; |同步/异步| H[(读库)]\n        H --&gt; F\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 CRUD</th>\n<th>CQRS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据模型</td>\n<td>读写共用一个模型</td>\n<td>读写各自独立模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化方向</td>\n<td>折中设计、难以极致</td>\n<td>各自针对性优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库</td>\n<td>通常单库</td>\n<td>可用不同存储引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>读写一起扩展</td>\n<td>读写独立扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>强一致性</td>\n<td>通常最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>显著增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>中小型系统</td>\n<td>读写比悬殊的大型系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CQRS 的理论根基来自 Bertrand Meyer 的命令查询分离（CQS）原则：一个方法要么改变状态（命令），要么返回结果（查询），绝不同时做两件事。CQRS 将这个方法级别的原则提升到了架构级别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命令查询分离原则\">命令查询分离原则</h2><p>CQS 原则在代码层面的体现非常直观：命令方法返回 <code>void</code>（只有副作用），查询方法是纯函数（只有返回值）。CQRS 将这个原则扩展到整个系统架构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CommandBus {&#10;  dispatch&lt;TCommand extends Command&gt;(command: TCommand): Promise&lt;CommandResult&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface QueryBus {&#10;  execute&lt;TQuery extends Query, TResult&gt;(query: TQuery): Promise&lt;TResult&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Command {&#10;  readonly type: string;&#10;  readonly aggregateId: string;&#10;  readonly timestamp: Date;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Query {&#10;  readonly type: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CommandResult {&#10;  readonly success: boolean;&#10;  readonly eventIds?: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;;&#10;  readonly error?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createCommandBus = (handlers: Map&lt;string, CommandHandler&gt;): CommandBus =&gt; ({&#10;  async dispatch(command) {&#10;    const handler = handlers.get(command.type);&#10;    if (!handler) {&#10;      return { success: false, error: `No handler for ${command.type}` };&#10;    }&#10;    return handler.handle(command);&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;const createQueryBus = (handlers: Map&lt;string, QueryHandler&gt;): QueryBus =&gt; ({&#10;  async execute(query) {&#10;    const handler = handlers.get(query.type);&#10;    if (!handler) {&#10;      throw new Error(`No handler for ${query.type}`);&#10;    }&#10;    return handler.handle(query);&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CommandBus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TCommand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CommandResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryBus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TQuery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> aggregateId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CommandResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> success</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> eventIds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createCommandBus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--