n style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadModel_OrderAnalytics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> totalOrders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> totalRevenue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> averageOrderValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> topProducts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>写模型包含完整的业务实体和不变量验证逻辑，而读模型则是为特定查询预先计算好的扁平化数据结构。订单列表视图不需要知道具体的收货地址，分析报表不需要知道每个订单的明细——各取所需。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用场景评估\">适用场景评估</h2><p>并非所有系统都需要 CQRS。对于简单的 CRUD 应用，引入 CQRS 会带来不必要的复杂度。评估是否需要 CQRS，可以从以下几个维度考量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>适合 CQRS</th>\n<th>不适合 CQRS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读写比</td>\n<td>读远大于写（&gt;10:1）</td>\n<td>读写均衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型差异</td>\n<td>写模型与读模型差异大</td>\n<td>读写模型高度一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展需求</td>\n<td>读写需要独立扩展</td>\n<td>整体规模可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询复杂度</td>\n<td>多维度复杂查询</td>\n<td>简单主键查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队规模</td>\n<td>大团队可并行开发</td>\n<td>小团队全栈开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性要求</td>\n<td>可接受最终一致</td>\n<td>必须强一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CqrsAssessment {&#10;  readWriteRatio: number;&#10;  modelDivergence: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;  scalingNeeds: &#39;uniform&#39; | &#39;read-heavy&#39; | &#39;write-heavy&#39;;&#10;  queryComplexity: &#39;simple&#39; | &#39;moderate&#39; | &#39;complex&#39;;&#10;  consistencyRequirement: &#39;strong&#39; | &#39;eventual&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const assessCqrsViability = (&#10;  assessment: CqrsAssessment,&#10;): {&#10;  recommendation: &#39;recommended&#39; | &#39;consider&#39; | &#39;avoid&#39;;&#10;  reasons: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;;&#10;} =&gt; {&#10;  const scores: number[] = [];&#10;  scores.push(assessment.readWriteRatio &gt; 10 ? 2 : assessment.readWriteRatio &gt; 3 ? 1 : 0);&#10;  scores.push(assessment.modelDivergence === &#39;high&#39; ? 2 : assessment.modelDivergence === &#39;medium&#39; ? 1 : 0);&#10;  scores.push(assessment.scalingNeeds !== &#39;uniform&#39; ? 2 : 0);&#10;  scores.push(assessment.queryComplexity === &#39;complex&#39; ? 2 : assessment.queryComplexity === &#39;moderate&#39; ? 1 : 0);&#10;  scores.push(assessment.consistencyRequirement === &#39;eventual&#39; ? 1 : -1);&#10;&#10;  const total = scores.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0);&#10;  if (total &gt;= 6) return { recommendation: &#39;recommended&#39;, reasons: [&#39;多维度评估显示高度适合&#39;] };&#10;  if (total &gt;= 3) return { recommendation: &#39;consider&#39;, reasons: [&#39;部分维度匹配，需权衡成本&#39;] };&#10;  return { recommendation: &#39;avoid&#39;, reasons: [&#39;复杂度收益比不足&#39;] };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CqrsAssessment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  readWriteRatio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  modelDivergence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scalingNeeds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'uniform'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'read-heavy'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'write-heavy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queryComplexity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'simple'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span sty