ryComplexity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'complex'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assessment.queryComplexity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'moderate'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(assessment.consistencyRequirement </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eventual'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> total</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { recommendation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'recommended'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reasons: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'多维度评估显示高度适合'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { recommendation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'consider'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reasons: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'部分维度匹配，需权衡成本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { recommendation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'avoid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reasons: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'复杂度收益比不足'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CQRS 与事件溯源是天然的搭配，但二者并非绑定关系。CQRS 可以在没有事件溯源的系统中使用（写模型用传统 ORM，读模型用物化视图），事件溯源也可以在没有 CQRS 的系统中使用（读写共用事件流重建的状态）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((CQRS 基础))&#10;    核心原则&#10;      命令查询分离&#10;      读写独立模型&#10;      各自优化&#10;    动机收益&#10;      独立扩展&#10;      模型自由&#10;      查询优化&#10;    适用评估&#10;      读写比悬殊&#10;      模型差异大&#10;      可接受最终一致&#10;    注意事项&#10;      非银弹&#10;      复杂度增加&#10;      不必与ES绑定\">mindmap\n  root((CQRS 基础))\n    核心原则\n      命令查询分离\n      读写独立模型\n      各自优化\n    动机收益\n      独立扩展\n      模型自由\n      查询优化\n    适用评估\n      读写比悬殊\n      模型差异大\n      可接受最终一致\n    注意事项\n      非银弹\n      复杂度增加\n      不必与ES绑定</pre><ul>\n<li>CQRS 将写操作（命令）和读操作（查询）拆分为两个独立模型，各自针对性优化</li>\n<li>命令总线和查询总线分离，为两条路径提供不同的中间件栈</li>\n<li>适用于读写比悬殊、读写模型差异大、需要多种查询视图的复杂系统</li>\n<li>CQRS 与事件溯源天然搭配但非绑定——两者可以独立使用</li>\n<li>对于简单 CRUD 应用，引入 CQRS 会带来不必要的复杂度，需要通过多维度评估决定是否采用</li>\n<li>最终一致性是 CQRS 架构的常见特征，如果业务严格要求强一致性，需要额外的设计处理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CQRS 基础","id":"cqrs-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"命令查询分离原则","id":"命令查询分离原则"},{"level":2,"text":"动机与收益","id":"动机与收益"},{"level":2,"text":"适用场景评估","id":"适用场景评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"快照与性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/event-sourcing-cqrs/event-sourcing-fundamentals/snapshots-and-optimization"},"next":{"title":"读写模型分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/event-sourcing-cqrs/cqrs-patterns/read-write-model-separation"}}